  "merger_description": "Total Drain Group Pty Ltd, trading as TDG Environmental (**TDG**), proposes to acquire 100% of the shares of Utility Management Group Pty Ltd, trading as Pipe Management Australia (**PMA**) (the **Acquisition**).\n\nTDG is a provider of stormwater and wastewater collection, maintenance and waste recycling services in Australia and New Zealand.\n\nPMA is a provider of stormwater and wastewater collection and maintenance (in particular relining) services operating in New South Wales (NSW) and Queensland (QLD).\n\nTDG and PMA (the **Parties**) overlap in the supply of collection and maintenance services in relation to stormwater and wastewater, and, to a more limited extent, infrastructure and commercial and industrial customers.\n\nLiquid waste collection and maintenance services comprise a range of services relating to the inspection, cleaning, maintenance and rehabilitation of stormwater drainage infrastructure, including drains, pits, culverts, pipes and gross pollutant traps. Services include jetting/vacuuming, gross pollutant trap (GPT) servicing, non-destructive digging (NDD), pipe remediation, CCTV inspection, and waste transport and disposal.",
